# Global Systems Simulation: A Civil Servant Module for Multilocational Participation.

**Authors:** Valadez, Joseph J.

## Abstract
Discusses the Civil Servant Module, a new component of Global Systems Simulation, a comprehensive person-computer model for investigating international affairs. Its telecommunication capability, logistics, functions, spatial flexibility, and advantages are described and its implications for applying Global Systems Simulation as a research and educational tool are suggested. (MBR)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ298391

